00:01:48.607 --> 00:01:53.227
Royalty and streaming companies, simply Wall Street lays out, let you capture commodity

00:01:53.227 --> 00:01:56.707
price upside without bearing exploration or operating costs.

00:01:57.267 --> 00:02:02.267
Those agreements convert a rising metal price into higher per share cash flow because the

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:05.687
holder is not on the hook for the miners sustaining capital expenditures.

00:02:06.347 --> 00:02:11.267
Think of it as collecting a cut of every taxi fare in a city fleet you do not fuel, insure,

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:11.867
or repair.

00:02:12.447 --> 00:02:16.047
When fares go up, your cut rises while the driver is still by the gas.

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:18.727
The screen on the TSX is practical.

00:02:18.727 --> 00:02:24.767
Compare enterprise value or EV to attributable production ounces and check the percentage

00:02:24.767 --> 00:02:26.527
of revenue tied to precious metals.

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.887
Pull the latest technical report for each major asset.

00:02:30.447 --> 00:02:32.907
Franco Nevada is the name under that screen today.

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:37.627
Note the attributable production figure and divide by the current enterprise value to

00:02:37.627 --> 00:02:39.607
arrive at an EV per ounce metric.

00:02:40.167 --> 00:02:45.387
When that metric sits below the sector median while gold prices are rising, the royalty structure

00:02:45.387 --> 00:02:48.767
tends to deliver leveraged returns relative to equity minors.

00:02:49.087 --> 00:02:53.707
A second check confirms that at least 70% of expected production comes from assets

00:02:53.707 --> 00:02:57.747
already in commercial production, rather than development stage projects,

00:02:58.127 --> 00:03:00.687
which cuts execution risk for the royalty holder.

00:03:01.207 --> 00:03:04.787
The technique works when metal prices trend higher and the royalty company

00:03:04.787 --> 00:03:06.687
keeps a diversified asset base.

00:03:07.207 --> 00:03:11.487
It weakens when operators face sustained cost inflation that reduces the royalties

00:03:11.487 --> 00:03:16.527
effective margin. That December gold move is the immediate price tailwind. These agreements

00:03:16.527 --> 00:03:22.584
translate directly into cash without the miners sustaining capital spend. The practice investment

00:03:22.584 --> 00:03:29.124
of the day is a simulated weekly hold in FNV, Franco-Navada Corporation, listed on the TSX

00:03:29.124 --> 00:03:34.464
in the precious metal sector, and this is a simulated trade for learning purposes with no real money.

00:03:34.984 --> 00:03:39.904
It demonstrates the royalty screen as a valuation entry on the guidance lift after the earnings

00:03:39.904 --> 00:03:44.964
beat, entered at the next session's open, held five sessions, and judged against the

00:03:44.964 --> 00:03:47.124
NASDAQ over those same five sessions.

00:03:47.604 --> 00:03:52.124
The technical setup is price action above the 50 session average with volume supporting

00:03:52.124 --> 00:03:52.584
the move.

00:03:53.144 --> 00:03:59.884
The stop loss sits 8% below entry, which caps the simulated loss at $80 on a $1,000 position

00:03:59.884 --> 00:04:03.544
if a gold reversal or an operator-specific production mishits.

00:04:04.024 --> 00:04:07.104
The target is plus 3% to plus 7%.

00:04:07.104 --> 00:04:12.964
Confidence is high because those three independent factors, the beat, the lift, and the gold sector

00:04:12.964 --> 00:04:17.024
tailwind, are the combination the record has scored positively before.

00:04:17.564 --> 00:04:22.804
In validation is a public filing that revises 2026 production or cost guidance lower.

00:04:23.364 --> 00:04:28.084
That filing, not a mood, is what would prove the thesis wrong before the simulated fill.

00:04:28.824 --> 00:04:32.204
Valuation discipline and catalyst confirmation shape this pick.

00:04:32.204 --> 00:04:38.004
We wait for a named catalyst and a pre-committed stop, and the sector rotation rule written after

00:04:38.004 --> 00:04:38.924
the ED hold.

00:04:39.404 --> 00:04:43.904
