00:04:43.904 --> 00:04:47.044
satisfied because gold and mining shares led this rebound.

00:04:47.644 --> 00:04:52.484
The five session clock forces a disciplined exit regardless of outcome, and the work

00:04:52.484 --> 00:04:57.104
you are practicing is reading technical reports for attributable production rather than headline

00:04:57.104 --> 00:05:01.744
revenue so you can quantify the margin expansion inside the royalty structure.

